// Syncthing ignore rules for this folder.
//
// Build artefacts and installed dependencies are NOT synced: they are large,
// churn constantly, and are platform-specific — node_modules built on Windows
// is not what a Raspberry Pi should run. Each machine runs `npm install`
// itself. (The ddouble-store folder has no .stignore, so it has been syncing
// ~900 package directories to the Pi.)
node_modules
dist
.vercel

// Syncthing's own per-folder state
.stversions

// Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
